{"id":"df7d22df7a30dedc","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-jump-operator.md","title":"Jump Operator","display":"df-jump-operator — Jump Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-jump-operator","aliases":["88-df-jump-operator"],"display":"df-jump-operator — Jump Operator","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-degree]]","[[88-df-jump-operator-def]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-jump-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-jump-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jump-operator — Jump Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4ee50f99db72eec\" href=\"?note=f4ee50f99db72eec\" title=\"88-df-turing-degree\">88-df-turing-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c749f46fbad31f8b\" href=\"?note=c749f46fbad31f8b\" title=\"88-df-jump-operator-def\">88-df-jump-operator-def</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(A)\">\\(J(A)\\)</span> (set-level Turing jump, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c749f46fbad31f8b\" href=\"?note=c749f46fbad31f8b\" title=\"88-df-jump-operator-def\">88-df-jump-operator-def</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg_T(A)\">\\(\\deg_T(A)\\)</span> (Turing degree, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4ee50f99db72eec\" href=\"?note=f4ee50f99db72eec\" title=\"88-df-turing-degree\">88-df-turing-degree</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_T\">\\(\\mathcal D_T\\)</span> (class of Turing degrees, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f4ee50f99db72eec\" href=\"?note=f4ee50f99db72eec\" title=\"88-df-turing-degree\">88-df-turing-degree</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_T\">\\(J_T\\)</span> (degree-jump relation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\nJ_T\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\deg_T(A),\\deg_T(J(A))\\rangle:A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\nJ_T\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\deg_T(A),\\deg_T(J(A))\\rangle:A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 作用于自然数集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_T\">\\(J_T\\)</span> 作用于 Turing 度；两者不再共用一个未定类型的撇号。</li>\n<li>Turing 等价在跳跃下保持，因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_T\">\\(J_T\\)</span> 是单值算子；严格增度由后续定理给出。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"f4ee50f99db72eec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-jump-operator-def","status":"resolved","id":"c749f46fbad31f8b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-jump-operator-def]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-jump-operator-def","status":"resolved","id":"c749f46fbad31f8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J(A)$ (set-level Turing jump, see [[88-df-jump-operator-def]])","embed":false},{"